  m_text: "<size=22>- During Base Games, 2 or more Scatters anywhere on reels triggers
    a Re-Spin.\n- When 2 or more Scatters appear on reels, line pays are evaluated,
    all Scatters get \n   locked in positions and all reels re-spin once.\n   - Line
    pays are not evaluated after the re-spin. \n- 3 or more Scatters triggers Free
    Games.\n</size>"
